{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 210,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- How many times do you need\nto shuffle a deck of cards"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3060,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make them truly random?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 5220,
    "dDurationMs": 3449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How much uranium does it\ntake to build a nuclear bomb?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8669,
    "dDurationMs": 1351,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(explosion booming)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10020,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How can you predict the\nnext word in a sentence?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 12870,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And how does Google know which page"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15210,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're actually searching for?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17040,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, the reason we know the answer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 18210,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to all of these questions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19590,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is because of a strange\nmath feud in Russia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 22500,
    "dDurationMs": 2373,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that took place over 100 years ago."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 26670,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1905, socialist\ngroups all across Russia"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29790,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rose up against the Tsar,\nthe ruler of the empire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33150,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They demanded a complete political reform,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 35640,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or failing that, that he stepped\ndown from power entirely."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39450,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- This divided the nation into two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41430,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So on one side you got\nthe Tsarists, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44040,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They wanted to defend the status quo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46140,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and keep the Tsar in power."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48060,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then on the other side,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49080,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you had the socialists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50370,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who wanted this complete political reform."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53310,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this division was so bad"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54750,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it crept into every part of society"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 57480,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the point where even mathematicians"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59250,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "started picking sides."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60960,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] On the side of\nthe Tsar was Pavel Nekrasov,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63840,
    "dDurationMs": 2902,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "unofficially called the\nTsar of Probability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 66742,
    "dDurationMs": 3518,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nekrasov was a deeply\nreligious and powerful man,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70260,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he used his status to\nargue that math could be used"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73110,
    "dDurationMs": 2643,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to explain free will and the will of God."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76830,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- His intellectual nemesis\non the socialist side"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79350,
    "dDurationMs": 3933,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was Andrey Markov, also\nknown as Andrey The Furious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84360,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Markov was an atheist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85710,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he had no patience for people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87360,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who were being unrigorous,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89160,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "something he considered Nekrasov to be,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 91380,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because in his eyes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92370,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "math had nothing to do\nwith free will or religion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95340,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he publicly criticized Nekrasov's work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98040,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "listing it among \"the\nabuses of mathematics.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 101520,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their feud centered on the main idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103440,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people had used to do probability\nfor the last 200 years."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106950,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we can illustrate this\nwith a simple coin flip."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110280,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When I flip the coin 10 times,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 111720,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I get six times heads\nand four times tails,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114450,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is obviously not\nthe 50/50 you'd expect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117390,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if I keep flipping the coin,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 119130,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then at first the ratio\njumps all over the place."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 122070,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But after a large number of flips,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124140,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we see that it slowly settles\ndown and approaches 50/50."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 128010,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in this case, after 100 flips,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 130530,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we end up on 51 heads and 49 tails,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134070,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is almost exactly\nwhat you would expect."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137370,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This behavior that the average outcome"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139500,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gets closer and closer\nto the expected value"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 142110,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as you run more and\nmore independent trials"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 144540,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is known as the law of large numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147210,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was first proven by\nJacob Bernoulli in 1713,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150840,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it was the key concept"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 152190,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the heart of probability theory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154200,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "right up until Markov and Nekrasov."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 156750,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Bernoulli only proved"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158460,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it worked for independent events"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 160290,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like a fair coin flip,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162060,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or when you ask people to guess"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 163740,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how much they think an item is worth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165900,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where one event doesn't\ninfluence the others."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 169290,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now imagine that instead\nof asking each person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172290,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to submit their guess individually,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174420,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you ask people to shout\nout their answer in public."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177900,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, in this case,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 178980,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the first person might think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180270,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's an extraordinarily valuable item,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 182490,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and say it's worth around $2,000,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185580,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but now all the other people in the room"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187950,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are influenced by this value,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189630,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so, their guesses\nhave become dependent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192840,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And now the average doesn't\nconverge to the true value,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196140,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but instead it clusters\naround a higher amount."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199560,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And so, for 200 years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201420,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "probability had relied\non this key assumption,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204300,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you need independence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206040,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to observe the law of large numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208680,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this was the idea"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 210030,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that sparked Nekrasov and Markov's feud."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 212820,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, Nekrasov agreed with Bernoulli"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214830,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you need independence to\nget the law of large numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 217800,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But he took it one step further."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219780,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He said, if you see the\nlaw of large numbers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222300,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can infer that the underlying events"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224880,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "must be independent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 227550,
    "dDurationMs": 4830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Take this table of Belgian\nmarriages from 1841 to 1845."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 232380,
    "dDurationMs": 3117,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you see that every year\nthe average is about 29,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 235497,
    "dDurationMs": 2793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, it seems like the values converge"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 238290,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and therefore that they follow\nthe law of large numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241140,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when Nekrasov looked\nat other social statistics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 243720,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like crime rates and birth rates,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245820,
    "dDurationMs": 2157,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he noticed a similar pattern."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 247977,
    "dDurationMs": 2673,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But now think about where\nall this data is coming from."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 250650,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's coming from decisions to get married,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252990,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "decisions to commit crimes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254520,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and decisions to have babies,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 256140,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at least for the most part."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258210,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Nekrasov reasoned that\nbecause these statistics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 260490,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "followed the law of large numbers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262140,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the decisions causing\nthem must be independent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 264810,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In other words,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265770,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he argued that they must\nbe acts of free will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 269040,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to him, free will wasn't\njust something philosophical,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272190,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it was something you could measure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274050,
    "dDurationMs": 1533,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was scientific."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 277110,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] But to Markov,\nNekrasov was delusional."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280740,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He thought it was absurd"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 281880,
    "dDurationMs": 2763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to link mathematical\nindependence to free will."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 285720,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Markov set out to prove\nthat dependent events"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288750,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could also follow the\nlaw of large numbers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 291450,
    "dDurationMs": 3663,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that you can still do\nprobability with dependent events."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 296430,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- To do this, he needed something"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297930,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where one event clearly\ndepended on what came before,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 301320,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he got the idea that\nthis is what happens in text."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304650,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether your next letter\nis a consonant or a vowel"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307500,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "depends heavily on what\nthe current letter is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310530,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to test this, Markov turned to a poem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313140,
    "dDurationMs": 1927,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the heart of Russian literature,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 315067,
    "dDurationMs": 2606,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Eugene Onegin\" by Alexander Pushkin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319050,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- He took the first 20,000\nletters of the poem,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321540,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stripped out all punctuation and spaces,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 324090,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and pushed them together into\none long string of characters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 327810,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He counted the letters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328860,
    "dDurationMs": 4620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and found that 43% were vowels\nand 57% were consonants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 333480,
    "dDurationMs": 3630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then Markov broke the string\ninto overlapping pairs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337110,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that gave him four possible combinations,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 339720,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "vowel-vowel, consonant-consonant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341700,
    "dDurationMs": 2948,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "vowel-consonant, or consonant-vowel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344648,
    "dDurationMs": 2212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, if the letters were independent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 346860,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the probability of a vowel-vowel pair"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348720,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would just be the\nprobability of a vowel twice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 351600,
    "dDurationMs": 3603,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is about 0.18 or an 18% chance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 356160,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when Markov actually counted,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358410,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he found vowel-vowel pairs\nonly show up 6% of the time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 363150,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "way less than if they were independent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 366240,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And when he checked the other pairs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 367890,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he found that all actual\nvalues differed greatly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 370920,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from what the independent\ncase would predict."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 373860,
    "dDurationMs": 3273,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Markov had shown that\nthe letters were dependent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 378090,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And to beat Nekrasov, all\nhe needed to do now was show"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 381030,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that these letters still followed\nthe law of large numbers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 384030,
    "dDurationMs": 4020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he created a prediction\nmachine of sorts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 388050,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He started by drawing two circles,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 390060,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one for a vowel and one for a consonant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 392430,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These were his states."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 394410,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, say you're at a vowel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 396150,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then the next letter could\neither be a vowel or a consonant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 399660,
    "dDurationMs": 3280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he drew two arrows to\nrepresent these transitions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 402940,
    "dDurationMs": 3500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what are these\ntransition probabilities?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 406440,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, Markov knew that if you\npick a random starting point,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 409320,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there is a 43% chance\nthat it'll be a vowel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 412440,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He also knew that vowel-vowel pairs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 414450,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "occur about 6% of the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417150,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to find the probability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 418260,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of going from a vowel to another vowel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420450,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he divided 0.06 by 0.43"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 423450,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to find a transition\nprobability of about 13%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 427140,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And since there is a 100% chance"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429420,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that another letter comes next,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 431430,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all the arrows going from the same state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433620,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "need to add up to one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 435360,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the chance of going to a consonant"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 437190,
    "dDurationMs": 4380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is one minus 0.13, or 87%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 441570,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He repeated this process\nfor the consonants"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 443520,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to complete his predictive machine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 445980,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's see how it works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448890,
    "dDurationMs": 1233,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We'll start at a vowel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 451170,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next, we generate a random\nnumber between zero and one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 454710,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it's below 0.13, we get another vowel,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 457470,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if it's above, we get a consonant."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 459840,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We got 0.78, so we get a consonant,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462660,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then we generate another number,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 463980,
    "dDurationMs": 2923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and check if it's above or below 0.67,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466903,
    "dDurationMs": 2150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "0.21, so we get a vowel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 470010,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, we can keep doing this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471390,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and keep track of the ratio\nof vowels to consonants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474570,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At first, the ratio\njumps all over the place,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 477210,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but after a while, it\nconverges to a steady value,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 480960,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "43% vowels and 57% consonants,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 484230,
    "dDurationMs": 3363,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the exact split Markov\nhad counted by hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 489210,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Markov had built a dependent system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 491820,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a literal chain of events,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 493890,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and he showed that it still followed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495690,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the law of large numbers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497250,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which meant that observing\nconvergence in social statistics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500040,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "didn't prove that the underlying\ndecisions were independent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 503160,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In other words,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504150,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those statistics don't\nprove free will at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507330,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Markov had shattered Nekrasov's\nargument, and he knew it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 511200,
    "dDurationMs": 3757,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So he ended his paper with\none final dig at his rival."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 514957,
    "dDurationMs": 4223,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Thus, free will is not\nnecessary to do probability.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 519180,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In fact, independence"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 520770,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "isn't even necessary to do probability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523170,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With this Markov chain,\nas it came to be known,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 525840,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he found a way to do probability\nwith dependent events."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 529590,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This should have been a huge breakthrough,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 531630,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because in the real world,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533190,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost everything is\ndependent on something else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 536160,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, the weather tomorrow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 537750,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "depends on the conditions today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 540240,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How a disease spreads"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 541320,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "depends on who's infected right now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 543447,
    "dDurationMs": 1953,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the behavior of particles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 545400,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "depends on the behavior\nof particles around them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 548820,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Many of these processes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550200,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could be modeled using Markov chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553590,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do people think it was\nlike a mic drop moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 555390,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and like, \"Oh, Nekrasov's\nout, like, Markov's the man\"?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 559311,
    "dDurationMs": 2396,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Or people didn't really\nnotice, or it was obscure, or?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 562740,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I feel like people didn't really notice,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 565560,
    "dDurationMs": 2133,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, it wasn't a really big thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 568770,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And Markov himself\nseemingly didn't care much"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571530,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about how it might be\napplied to practical events."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 574560,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wrote, \"I'm concerned\nonly with questions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577230,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of pure analysis."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 578760,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I refer to the question\nof the applicability"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581250,
    "dDurationMs": 1407,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with indifference.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 583740,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Little did he know that this\nnew form of probability theory"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 587250,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would soon play a major role"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589050,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in one of the most important developments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 591180,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the 20th century."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 594300,
    "dDurationMs": 3810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On the morning of the 16th of July, 1945,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 598110,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the United States detonated The Gadget,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 601230,
    "dDurationMs": 2253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the world's first nuclear bomb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 604860,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The six kilogram plutonium\nbomb created an explosion"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 608160,
    "dDurationMs": 4530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was equivalent to\nnearly 25,000 tons of TNT."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 612690,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This was the culmination"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 614340,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the top secret Manhattan Project,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616950,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a three-year long effort"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 618330,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by some of the smartest people alive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620820,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including people like\nJ. Robert Oppenheimer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 623190,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "John von Neumann,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624750,
    "dDurationMs": 2793,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a little known mathematician\nnamed Stanislaw Ulam."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629820,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] Even after the war ended,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631290,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ulam continued trying to figure out"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633060,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how neutrons behave inside a nuclear bomb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635910,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, a nuclear bomb works\nsomething like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 638550,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Say you have a core of uranium-235,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 641430,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then when a neutron hits a U-235 nucleus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 644640,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the nucleus splits releasing energy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646890,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and, crucially, two or\nthree more neutrons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650370,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If, on average, those\nnew neutrons go on to hit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 652860,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and split more than one\nother U-235 nucleus,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 656070,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you get a runaway chain reaction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658380,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so you have a nuclear bomb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660660,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But uranium-235, the fissile\nfuel needed for the bombs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 663960,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was really hard to get."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 665550,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So one of the key questions\nwas just how much of it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 668400,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "do you need to build a bomb?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 670320,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is why Ulam wanted to understand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 672570,
    "dDurationMs": 1803,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how the neutrons behave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 675450,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casper] But then in January of 1946,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 678090,
    "dDurationMs": 2864,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything came to a halt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680954,
    "dDurationMs": 3766,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ulam was struck by a sudden and\nsevere case of encephalitis,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684720,
    "dDurationMs": 3990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an inflammation of the brain,\nthat nearly killed him."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 688710,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His recovery was long and slow,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 690690,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with Ulam spending most\nof his time in beds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694020,
    "dDurationMs": 4290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To pass the time, he played a\nsimple card game, Solitaire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698310,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as he played countless games,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 700200,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "winning some, losing others,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702570,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one question kept nagging at him,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 705030,
    "dDurationMs": 1050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what are the chances"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706080,
    "dDurationMs": 4079,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that a randomly-shuffled game\nof Solitaire could be won?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 710159,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was a deceivingly\ndifficult problem to solve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713580,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ulam played with all 52 cards"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 715770,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where each arrangement\ncreated a unique game,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 718410,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so the total number of possible\ngames was 52 factorial,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 722340,
    "dDurationMs": 2883,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or about eight times 10 to 67."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 726180,
    "dDurationMs": 2973,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So solving this analytically was hopeless."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 730200,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then Ulam had a flash of insight,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 732600,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what if I just play hundreds of games"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734550,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and count how many could be won?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 736830,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That would give him"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 737663,
    "dDurationMs": 2830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some sort of statistical\napproximation of the answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 741750,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Back at Los Alamos, the\nremaining scientists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 743970,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "grappled with much harder\nproblems than Solitaire,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746850,
    "dDurationMs": 3333,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like figuring out how neutrons\nbehave inside a nuclear core."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 751410,
    "dDurationMs": 870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a nuclear core,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 752280,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are trillions and\ntrillions of neutrons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754470,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "all interacting with their surroundings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756810,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the number of possible\noutcomes is immense,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759300,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and computing it directly\nseemed impossible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 762660,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] But when Ulam returned to work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 764400,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he had a sudden revelation."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 766710,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What if we could simulate these systems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 768450,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by generating lots of random outcomes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770820,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like I did with Solitaire?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 772860,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He shared this idea with von Neumann,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 774780,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who immediately recognized its power,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777270,
    "dDurationMs": 2163,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but also spotted a key problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 780390,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- See, in Solitaire,\neach game is independent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783240,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How the cards are dealt in one game"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 785010,
    "dDurationMs": 4093,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have no effect on the next,\nbut neutrons aren't like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 789103,
    "dDurationMs": 2417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A neutron's behavior\ndepends on where it is"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791520,
    "dDurationMs": 1773,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what it has done before."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794520,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you couldn't just\nsample random outcomes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 797040,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like in Solitaire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798330,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Instead, you needed to model\na whole chain of events"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801570,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where each step influenced the next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 804330,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What von Neumann realized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 805920,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that you needed a Markov chain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808890,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they made one"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810150,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a much simplified version of it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812040,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "works something like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 814110,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, the starting state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 815220,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is just a neutron\ntraveling through the core,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817740,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and from there, three things can happen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819780,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It can scatter off an\natom and keep traveling,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822810,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so that gives you an arrow\ngoing back to itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 825690,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It can leave the system"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826950,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or get absorbed by a non-fissile material,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829230,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in which case it no longer takes\npart in the chain reaction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 832470,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so it ends its Markov chain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 835170,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or it can strike another uranium-235 atom,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 838530,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "triggering a fission event"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 840150,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and releasing two or three more neutrons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 842490,
    "dDurationMs": 1923,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that then start their own chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 845340,
    "dDurationMs": 1170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in this chain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 846510,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the transition probabilities aren't fixed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 848850,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they depend on things like\nthe neutron's position,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 851250,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "velocity and energy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 852750,
    "dDurationMs": 3063,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as well as the overall\nconfiguration and mass of uranium."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 856950,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a fast-moving neutron might\nhave a 30% chance to scatter,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 860310,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a 50% chance to be absorbed or leave,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 862590,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a 20% chance to cause fission."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865080,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But a slower-moving neutron"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 866490,
    "dDurationMs": 1750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would have different probabilities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 869580,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Next, they ran this chain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 871080,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on the world's first\nelectronic computer, the ENIAC."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 874590,
    "dDurationMs": 930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The computer started"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875520,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by randomly generating a\nneutron starting conditions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878160,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and stepped through the chain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 879300,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to keep track of how many neutrons"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 880950,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were produced on average per run,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 883500,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "known as the multiplication factor k."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 886410,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if, on average, one neutron"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888420,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "produces another two neutrons,\nthen k is equal to two."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892380,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if on average every two\nneutrons produce three neutrons,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 895950,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then k is equal to three\nover two, and so on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 899400,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Then, after stepping\nthrough the full chain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901230,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a specified number of steps,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903120,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we collect the average k-value"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904890,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and record that number in a histogram."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907500,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This process was then\nrepeated hundreds of times,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 910110,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the results tallied up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911790,
    "dDurationMs": 3491,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "giving you a statistical\ndistribution of the outcome."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915281,
    "dDurationMs": 3109,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you find that in most\ncases, k is less than one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 918390,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the reaction dies down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 919890,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it's equal to one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 921270,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's a self-sustaining chain reaction,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 923400,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it doesn't grow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924840,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if k is larger than one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926400,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the reaction grows exponentially"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928320,
    "dDurationMs": 1443,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you've got a bomb."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931290,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- With it, von Neumann and\nUlam had a statistical way"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934140,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to figure out how many\nneutrons were produced"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936690,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without having to do\nany exact calculations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 939810,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In other words,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940643,
    "dDurationMs": 1957,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they could approximate\ndifferential equations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942600,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that were too hard to solve analytically."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 945660,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All that was needed was a\nname for the new method."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948960,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, Ulam's uncle was a gambler,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951090,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the random sampling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952200,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and high stakes reminded Ulam"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 954180,
    "dDurationMs": 4050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the Monte Carlo Casino in\nMonaco, and the name stuck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958230,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The  Monte\nCarlo method was born."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961650,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The method was so successful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963510,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it didn't stay secret for long."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 965940,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the end of 1948,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 967530,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "scientists at another\nlab, Argonne, in Chicago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970470,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "used it to study nuclear reactor designs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973140,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and from there, the idea spread quickly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976435,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ulam later remarked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 978187,
    "dDurationMs": 2873,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"It is still an unending\nsource of surprise for me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 981060,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to see how a few scribbles on a blackboard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 983400,
    "dDurationMs": 2577,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "could change the course of human affairs.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987180,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it wouldn't be the last time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 988770,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Markov chain based method"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990090,
    "dDurationMs": 2595,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "changed the course of human affairs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992685,
    "dDurationMs": 3195,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(upbeat music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 995880,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- In 1993, the internet\nwas open to the public,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999090,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and soon it exploded."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1001280,
    "dDurationMs": 3600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By the mid-1990s, thousands of\nnew pages appeared every day,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1004880,
    "dDurationMs": 3123,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that number was only growing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1008003,
    "dDurationMs": 2757,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This created a new kind of problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1010760,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, how do you find anything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012500,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this ever-expending sea of information?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015650,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1994, two Stanford PhD students,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018710,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jerry Yang and David Filo,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020600,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "founded the search engine Yahoo,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022310,
    "dDurationMs": 4140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to address this issue,\nbut they needed money."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026450,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So a year later, they arranged to meet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028700,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with Japanese billionaire, Masayoshi Son,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1031460,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "also known as the Bill Gates of Japan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033980,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(gong clangs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035180,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- They were looking to raise $5 million"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037370,
    "dDurationMs": 3843,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for their next startup,\nbut Son has other plans."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1042170,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He offers to invest a\nfull $100 million instead."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046010,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's 20 times more than\nwhat the founders asked for."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1049430,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Jerry Yang declines saying,\n\"We don't need that much,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1053120,
    "dDurationMs": 2077,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but Son disagrees,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1055197,
    "dDurationMs": 3219,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Jerry, everyone needs $100 million.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1058416,
    "dDurationMs": 1724,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Son laughs)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1060140,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Before the founders get\na chance to respond,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062390,
    "dDurationMs": 1717,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Son jumps in again and asks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1064107,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Who are your biggest competitors?\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1066027,
    "dDurationMs": 3293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Excite and lycos,\" the pair respond."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1069320,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Son orders his associate\nto write those names down."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1071930,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And then he says, \"If you\ndon't let me invest in Yahoo,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1074750,
    "dDurationMs": 3417,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I will invest in one of\nthem and I'll kill you.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1079160,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, Son had realized something."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081380,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of the leading\nsearch engines at the time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1083630,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "had any superior technology."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1085670,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They didn't have a technological\nadvantage over the others."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1089180,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They all just ranked pages"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090890,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by how often a search term\nappears on a given page."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1094310,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the battle for the\nnumber one search engine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1096650,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would be decided by who\ncould attract the most users,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1099590,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who could spend the most on marketing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1101840,
    "dDurationMs": 1857,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Announcer 1] Lycos, go get it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1103697,
    "dDurationMs": 2763,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Announcer 2] Get Lycos, or get lost."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106460,
    "dDurationMs": 2159,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Announcer 3] This is revolution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1108619,
    "dDurationMs": 2797,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(upbeat funky music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1111416,
    "dDurationMs": 2184,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "♪ Yahoo ♪"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1113600,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] And marketing\nrequired a lot of money,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1115700,
    "dDurationMs": 4950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "money that Son had, so he\ncould decide who won the war."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120650,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yahoo's founders realized they\nwere left with no real choice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1123500,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but to accept Son's investment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126200,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Speaker] So here we are,\nright in the middle of Yahoo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1128540,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] And within four years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129770,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yahoo became the most\npopular site on the planet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132950,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Reporter] In the time it\ntakes to say this sentence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1135500,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yahoo will answer 79,000\ninformation requests worldwide,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140510,
    "dDurationMs": 4207,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the two men are now\nworth $120 million each."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1144717,
    "dDurationMs": 2000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "♪ Yahoo ♪"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147710,
    "dDurationMs": 3033,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But Yahoo had a critical weakness."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1151640,
    "dDurationMs": 2940,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See, Yahoo's keyword\nsearch was easy to trick."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1154580,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To get your page ranked highly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155990,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you could just repeat\nkeywords hundreds of times,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1158600,
    "dDurationMs": 2403,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hidden with white text\non a white background."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161990,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- One thing they didn't\nhave in those early days"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1165080,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was a notion of quality of the result."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1168230,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they had a notion of relevance saying,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1171350,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "does this document talk about the thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173810,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you're interested in?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1175610,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there wasn't really a\nnotion of which ones are better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1179180,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What they really needed\nwas a way to rank pages"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1181550,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by both relevance and quality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1184130,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But how do you measure\nthe quality of a webpage?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186770,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, to understand that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1188090,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we need to borrow an idea from libraries."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1190490,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So I'm old enough that library books"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1193220,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "used to have a paper card in it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1195260,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that was a stamp of all the due dates"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197240,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of when it was due back."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198500,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You took a book and if\nit had a lot of those,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1200210,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you said, \"Oh, this is\nprobably a good book.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1201860,
    "dDurationMs": 2017,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if it didn't have any, you said,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1203877,
    "dDurationMs": 2273,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Well, maybe this isn't the best book.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1206150,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Stamps acted like endorsements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1207890,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The more stamps, the\nbetter the book must be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1209990,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the same idea can\nbe applied to the web."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1212840,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over at Stanford, two PhD students,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1215210,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Sergey Brin and Larry Page,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1216980,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "were working on this exact problem."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1219320,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brin and Page realized\nthat each link to a page"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1222470,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can be thought of as an endorsement."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1224630,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the more links a page sends out,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1226520,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the less valuable each vote becomes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1229730,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So what they realized is\nthat we can model the web"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1232310,
    "dDurationMs": 1053,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as a Markov chain."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234680,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] To see how this works,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1236120,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "imagine a toy internet\nwith just four webpages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1239300,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Call them Amy, Ben, Chris, and Dan."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1242570,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are our states."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1244310,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Typically, one webpage links to others,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246560,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "allowing you to move between them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1248330,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are our transitions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250490,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this setup, Amy only links to Ben,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1252860,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so there's a 100% chance\nof going from Amy to Ben."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1256790,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ben links to Amy, Chris, and Dan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1258980,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so there's a 33% chance of\ngoing to any of those pages,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262670,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we can fill out the other\ntransition probabilities"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265010,
    "dDurationMs": 1113,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the same way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1267050,
    "dDurationMs": 2973,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So now we can run this Markov\nchain and see what happens."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1270890,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Imagine you're a surfer on this web."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1273110,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You start on a random page, say, Amy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1275630,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you keep running the machine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1277520,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and keep track of the percentage of time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1279290,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you spend on each page."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1281540,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over time, the ratio settles"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1283610,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the scores give us some measure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1285380,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of the relative importance of these pages."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1288200,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You spend the most time on Ben,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1289640,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so Ben is ranked first,\nfollowed by Amy, then Dan,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1292910,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and lastly Chris."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1294980,
    "dDurationMs": 2730,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It might seem like there's an\neasy way to beat the system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1297710,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just make 100 pages all\nlinking to your website."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1300740,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now you get 100 full votes"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1302480,
    "dDurationMs": 4740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you'll always rank on\ntop, but that is not the case."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1307220,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While during their first few steps,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1308870,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they might make your page seem important,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1310970,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "none of the other websites link to them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1313070,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So over many steps, their\ncontributions don't matter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1317150,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You might have many links,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1318530,
    "dDurationMs": 1530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they're not quality links,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1320060,
    "dDurationMs": 1833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so they don't affect the algorithm."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1323780,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But there is still one problem, though,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1325820,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not all pages are connected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1327710,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In networks like this one,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329210,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a random server can get stuck in a loop,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1331400,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "never reaching the rest of the web."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1333620,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to fix this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1335030,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can set a rule that 85% of the time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1337940,
    "dDurationMs": 2910,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "our random server just\nfollows a link like normal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1340850,
    "dDurationMs": 2100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then for about 15% of the time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1342950,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they just jump to a page at random."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1345650,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This damping factor makes sure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1347330,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that we explore all\npossible parts of the web"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1349640,
    "dDurationMs": 1683,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without ever getting stuck."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1352400,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By using Markov chains,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1354020,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Page and Brin had built\na better search engine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1356660,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they called it PageRank."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1358550,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Because it's talking\nabout how pages react,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362420,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "webpages react with each other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1363770,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and also 'cause the\nfounder's name is Larry Page,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1366530,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so he snuck that in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1368240,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- With PageRank,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1369140,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Google got much better search results,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1371360,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "often getting you to the site"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372740,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you were looking for in one go."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1374930,
    "dDurationMs": 3218,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Although, to some, this\nsounded like a terrible idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1378148,
    "dDurationMs": 2722,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Others said, \"Oh, well you're\ntelling me you get a search"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1380870,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that will get the right\nresult on the first answer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1384170,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I don't want that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1385010,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because if it takes them\nthree or four chances,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1388910,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "searches to get the right answer,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1390500,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then I have three or\nfour chances to show ads,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1393260,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and if you get 'em the answer right away,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1395270,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm just gonna lose them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1396290,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, you know, I don't see\nwhy better search is better.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1400460,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But Page and Brin disagreed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1402200,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They were convinced that if\ntheir product was far superior,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1404960,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then people would flock to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1406730,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I would say it actually\nis a democracy that works."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1410420,
    "dDurationMs": 1778,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If all pages were equal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1412198,
    "dDurationMs": 2932,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anybody can manufacture as\nmany pages as they want."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1415130,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I can set up a billion\npages in my server tomorrow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1418400,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We shouldn't treat them all as equal."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1420200,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just looking at the data out of curiosity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1422990,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we found that we had technology"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1424280,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to do a better job of search,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1425780,
    "dDurationMs": 3930,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we realized how impactful\nhaving great search can be."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1429710,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And so, in 1998, they\nlaunched their new search engine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1433040,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to take on Yahoo."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1434510,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Initially, they called it BackRub,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1436370,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after the backlinks it analyzed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1438650,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then they realized"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439483,
    "dDurationMs": 2767,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that maybe that's not\nthe most attractive name."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1442250,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, their ambitions were big"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1443810,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to essentially index all\nthe pages on the internet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1446930,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they needed a name equally as big."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1449420,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So they thought of the largest\nnumber they could think of,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1452450,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "10 to the power of 100, a googol."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1455510,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But then when trying to\nregister their domain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1457730,
    "dDurationMs": 1587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they accidentally misspelled it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1459317,
    "dDurationMs": 2527,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, Google was born."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461844,
    "dDurationMs": 2750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(dramatic music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1466650,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over the next four years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1467990,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Google overthrew Yahoo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1469490,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to become the most used search engine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1471530,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Everyone who knows the internet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1472970,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "almost certainly knows Google."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1474830,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Googling is like oxygen to teenagers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1477890,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Casper] And today, Alphabet,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1479270,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is Google's parent company,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1480890,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is worth around $2 trillion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1483290,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When Google makes even\nthe slightest change"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1485810,
    "dDurationMs": 2603,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in its algorithms, it\ncan have huge effects."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1488413,
    "dDurationMs": 997,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Google.\n- Google."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1489410,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Google.\n- Google."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1491780,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- They're on fire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1492740,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the reason why they're on fire"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1493970,
    "dDurationMs": 1110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is because they're focused"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1495080,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they're more focused\nthan Yahoo who does search,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1497060,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're more focused than Microsoft"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1498380,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who does search with Bing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1499580,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yahoo has lots of\ntraffic, they always have,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1501590,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they have some really great properties,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1503240,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but I don't think Yahoo is\nthe go-to place, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1506480,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And at the heart of this\ntrillion dollar algorithm"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1509330,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a Markov chain, which only\nlooks at the current state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1512900,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to predict what's going to happen next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1515990,
    "dDurationMs": 2790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in the 1940s, Claude Shannon,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1518780,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the father of information theory,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1520640,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "started asking a different question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1523460,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He went back to Markov's\noriginal idea of predicting text,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1526850,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but instead of just using\nvowels and consonants,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1529250,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he focused on individual letters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1531890,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And he wondered,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532790,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what if instead of looking"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1534020,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at only the last letter as a predictor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1536060,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I look at the last two?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1537950,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, with that, he got\ntext that looked like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1541130,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, it doesn't make much sense,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1542450,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but there are some recognizable words"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1544430,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like \"whey\", \"of\", and \"the\"."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1547700,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Shannon was convinced\nhe could do better."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1549890,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So next, instead of looking at letters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1552050,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he wondered, what if I use\nentire words as predictors?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1555740,
    "dDurationMs": 2137,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That gave him sentences like this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1557877,
    "dDurationMs": 2903,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"The head and in frontal\nattack on an English writer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1560780,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the character of this point"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562280,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is therefore another\nmethod for the letters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1564680,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the time of who ever told the problem"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1567320,
    "dDurationMs": 1377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for an unexpected.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1569630,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now, clearly, this doesn't make any sense,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1572270,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but Shannon did notice that\nsequences of four words or so"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1575480,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "generally did make sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1577220,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For instance, \"attack\non an English writer\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1579860,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "kind of makes sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1581450,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Shannon learned that\nyou can make better"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1583400,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and better predictions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1584480,
    "dDurationMs": 1950,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "about what the next word is going to be"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1586430,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by taking into account more\nand more of the previous words."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1590600,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's kind of like what Gmail does"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1592310,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when it predicts what\nyou're going to type next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1595490,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And this is no coincidence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1597290,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the algorithms that make these predictions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1599450,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are based on Markov chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1601520,
    "dDurationMs": 2913,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- They're not necessarily\nusing letters, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1604433,
    "dDurationMs": 867,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Yeah"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1605300,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they use what they call tokens,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1607310,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some of which are letters,\nsome of which are words,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1610340,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "marks of punctuation, whatever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1612680,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's a bigger set\nthan just the alphabet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1616190,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The game is simply, we\nhave this string of tokens"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1620390,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that, you know, might be 30 long,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1624170,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we're asking what are the odds"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1626630,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the next token is\nthis or this or this?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1629450,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] But today's\nlarge language models"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1630830,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "don't treat all those tokens equally,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1633230,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because unlike simple Markov chains,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1635030,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they also use something called attention,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1637070,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which tells the model\nwhat to pay attention to."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1640040,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in the phrase, \"the\nstructure of the cell,\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1642500,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the model can use previous context"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1644570,
    "dDurationMs": 1380,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like blood and mitochondria"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1645950,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to know the cell most likely refers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1648230,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to biology rather than a prison cell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1650450,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it uses that to tune its prediction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1653750,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as large language models\nbecome more widespread,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1656390,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "one concern is that the text they produce"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1658430,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ends up on the internet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1659570,
    "dDurationMs": 3183,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that becomes training\ndata for future models."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1663860,
    "dDurationMs": 1593,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- When you start doing that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1667070,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the game is very soon over."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1668990,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You come, in this case, to\nus, a very dull, stable state,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1672530,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it just says the same thing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1673670,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "over and over and over again forever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1675470,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The language models are\nvulnerable to this process."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1679430,
    "dDurationMs": 2850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- And any system like this\nwhere we have a feedback loop,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1682280,
    "dDurationMs": 3480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "will become hard to model\nusing Markov chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1685760,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Take global warming, for instance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1687380,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as we increase the amount of\ncarbon dioxide in the air,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1689690,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the average temperature\nof the Earth increases."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1692330,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But as the temperature increases,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1693680,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the atmosphere can hold more water vapor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1695810,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is an incredibly\npowerful greenhouse gas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1698390,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And with more water vapor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1699800,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the temperature increases further"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1701360,
    "dDurationMs": 2010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "allowing for even more water vapor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1703370,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you get this positive feedback loop,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1705350,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which makes it hard to predict\nwhat's going to happen next."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1708410,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So there are some systems\nwhere Markov chains don't work,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1711740,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but for many other dependent systems,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1713540,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they offer a way of doing probability."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1716510,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But what's fascinating"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1717710,
    "dDurationMs": 3540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that all these systems\nhave extremely long histories."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1721250,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, you could trace back\nall the letters in a text,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1723890,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "trace back all the interactions\nof what a neutron did,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1726470,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or trace back the weather for weeks."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1729110,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the beautiful thing\nMarkov and others found"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1731600,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is that for many of these systems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1733460,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can ignore almost all of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1735740,
    "dDurationMs": 2220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can just look at the current state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1737960,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and forget about the rest,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1740240,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that makes these systems memoryless."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1742940,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's this memoryless property"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1745340,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that makes Markov chains so powerful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1747830,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it's what allows you"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1749090,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to take these extremely complex systems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1751580,
    "dDurationMs": 1770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and simplify them a lot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1753350,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to still make meaningful predictions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1756230,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Derek] As one paper\nput it, \"Problem-solving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1758060,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is often a matter of cooking up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1759710,
    "dDurationMs": 1677,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an appropriate Markov chain.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1762230,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's kind of ridiculous to me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1763970,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that this basic fact of mathematics"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1766640,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "would come out of a fight like that,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1768620,
    "dDurationMs": 2610,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which, you know, really\nhad nothing to do with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1771230,
    "dDurationMs": 2340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But all the evidence suggests"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1773570,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that it really was this determination"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1776690,
    "dDurationMs": 4830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to show up Nekrasov that\nled Markov to do the work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1781520,
    "dDurationMs": 3120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But there's one question\nwe still haven't answered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1784640,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When playing Solitaire,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1786230,
    "dDurationMs": 3210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how did Ulam know his cards\nwere perfectly shuffled?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1789440,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, how many shuffles does it take"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1791990,
    "dDurationMs": 4110,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get a completely random\narrangement of cards?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1796100,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- If you have a deck of cards,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1797810,
    "dDurationMs": 2250,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you need to shuffle it, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1800060,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How often, if you're\nshuffling, like, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1802100,
    "dDurationMs": 2009,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you split it in half, and then you do the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1804109,
    "dDurationMs": 1411,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(cards riffling)."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1805520,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How often do you have to shuffle it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1807590,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to make it completely random?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1809510,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Two.\n- Two?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1811160,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm going with 26."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1812240,
    "dDurationMs": 1620,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Yeah, four times.\n- Four times?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1813860,
    "dDurationMs": 1976,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- I don't know, 52 times?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1815836,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Okay. Okay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1816669,
    "dDurationMs": 1551,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not a bad guess."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1818220,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Seven?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1819240,
    "dDurationMs": 1790,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It is seven."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1821030,
    "dDurationMs": 1020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Really?\n- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1822050,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So you can think of card\nshuffling as a Markov chain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1824420,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where each deck arrangement is a state,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1826940,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then each shuffle is a step."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1828800,
    "dDurationMs": 1640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so for a deck of 52 cards,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1830440,
    "dDurationMs": 2350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if you riffle shuffle it seven times,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1832790,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then every arrangement of the\ndeck is about equally likely,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1835670,
    "dDurationMs": 1773,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so it's basically random."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1838880,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I can't shuffle like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1840590,
    "dDurationMs": 3180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So for me, what I do is I do it like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1843770,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How many times do you think\nyou have to shuffle like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1845810,
    "dDurationMs": 1463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to get it random?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1847273,
    "dDurationMs": 1027,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(beeping)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1848300,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What do you think?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1849650,
    "dDurationMs": 1740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And perhaps more importantly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1851390,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how would you go about working it out?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1854090,
    "dDurationMs": 2490,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, that's where today's\nsponsor Brilliant comes in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1856580,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Brilliant is a learning app"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1857900,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that gets you hands-on with\nproblems just like this."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1861290,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Whether it's math, physics, programming,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1863690,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or even AI, Brilliant's\ninteractive lessons and challenges"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1867140,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "let you play your way to a sharper mind."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1869900,
    "dDurationMs": 3030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can discover how large\nlanguage models actually work"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1872930,
    "dDurationMs": 3270,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from basic Markov chains\nto complex neural networks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1876200,
    "dDurationMs": 3450,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or dig into the math behind\nthis shuffling question."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1879650,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a fun way to build\nknowledge and skills"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1881690,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that help you solve all kinds of problems,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1884150,
    "dDurationMs": 2370,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which brings us back to our shuffle."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1886520,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So Casper, what actually is the answer?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1889580,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- It's actually over 2,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1891500,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- What?\n- Over-"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1892333,
    "dDurationMs": 1087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Crazy, right?\n- Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1893420,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- So the next time someone\noffers to shuffle before a game,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1896090,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "make sure they're doing it right,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1897590,
    "dDurationMs": 2580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "seven riffles or it doesn't count."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1900170,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the interesting part"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1901250,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "isn't just knowing that,\nit's understanding why"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1903950,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and seeing how a simple question"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1905450,
    "dDurationMs": 3780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can lead you to some\nsurprisingly complex mathematics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1909230,
    "dDurationMs": 2801,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And that's what Brilliant is all about."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1912031,
    "dDurationMs": 3259,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So to try everything Brilliant\nhas to offer for free"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1915290,
    "dDurationMs": 1200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for a full 30 days,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1916490,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "visit brilliant.org/veritasium,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1918890,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "click that link in the description"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1920390,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or scan this handy QR code."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1922790,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if you sign up,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1923690,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you'll also get 20% off their\nannual premium subscription."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1927010,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So I wanna thank Brilliant\nfor sponsoring this video"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1929330,
    "dDurationMs": 2298,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I wanna thank you for watching."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1931628,
    "dDurationMs": 2583,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(upbeat music)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1941150,
    "dDurationMs": 951,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Easy."
    } ]
